## Code Example

```csharp
// Azure Function: extract tenant and route to per-tenant resources
public static async Task<IActionResult> Run(HttpRequest req, ILogger log)
{
  string tenantId = req.Headers["X-Tenant-Id"].FirstOrDefault();
  if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(tenantId)) return new UnauthorizedResult();
  // Use tenantId for Cosmos/Blob operations
  return new OkResult();
}
